{
  "about": [
    "Forged pure observations kept as test inputs. Each is refused by one",
    "subcheck of the records-only re-rendering in",
    "tests/_pietto_sql_emission_pure_boundary.py, and",
    "test_kept_forgeries_are_refused_by_their_own_subcheck in",
    "tests/test_harness_sql_emission_portability.py judges it end to end and",
    "through the re-rendering alone.",
    "Source: an observation the pipeline emitted and pure accepts (the",
    "multi-key window ORDER one from an earlier pipeline's witnesses). Its",
    "records are edited as the file's class names; where the SQL changes,",
    "the SQL and its events are rendered again from the edited records by a",
    "subclass of the re-rendering that records each token it would write",
    "instead of comparing it, with the subcheck under test removed, and the",
    "generated requirements are reconciled with pure's own walk. The",
    "zero-column CTE one is not edited: it is an earlier pipeline's witness",
    "of SQL that is not valid, which the current pipeline refuses, kept",
    "without its expression ranges.",
    "Regenerate a file only by that procedure, never from the current",
    "checker's output. A file changes when the subcheck it pins does, and",
    "every file changes when the schema's record shapes or a target",
    "release do: by a mechanical edit of those fields or by the same",
    "procedure again, each reviewed as a source change. These are not",
    "goldens: docs/spec/golden-fixture-policy-v1.md governs",
    "tests/fixtures/golden/.",
    "Each entry names its file, the subcheck the re-rendering reports, and",
    "the end-to-end status and detail."
  ],
